// 正确结果：图表右上角显示 2 列 4 行表格，展示 O/H/L/C 价格；H 绿色，C 根据涨跌变色
indicator("Chart Test: graph/table/basic", overlay: true);

if bar_state.is_last {
    let t = Table.new(Position.TopRight, 2, 4,
        frame_color: Color.GRAY, frame_width: 2,
        border_color: Color.GRAY, border_width: 1
    );
    t.cell(0, 0, "Open",  bg_color: Color.GRAY, text_color: Color.WHITE);
    t.cell(1, 0, String.from(open,  Format.Mintick), text_color: chart.fg_color);
    t.cell(0, 1, "High",  bg_color: Color.GRAY, text_color: Color.WHITE);
    t.cell(1, 1, String.from(high,  Format.Mintick), text_color: Color.GREEN);
    t.cell(0, 2, "Low",   bg_color: Color.GRAY, text_color: Color.WHITE);
    t.cell(1, 2, String.from(low,   Format.Mintick), text_color: Color.RED);
    t.cell(0, 3, "Close", bg_color: Color.GRAY, text_color: Color.WHITE);
    t.cell(1, 3, String.from(close, Format.Mintick),
        text_color: close >= open ? Color.GREEN : Color.RED);
}
